# ma2 (2026-10-30 night): menu, profiled. Are the two menu levers additive (deferred stores shorten the GPU idle,
# skipping GPU-heavy dispatches shortens the GPU busy time)? If frame = GPU busy + GPU idle, ds+gpu6 gains both.
base-0 60
ds-1 60 deferstores on
